## R-FAP-3 — Compact Namespaces

```yaml
compact_namespaces:
  gov_c: "//gov/c/*"    → "go:/olym/c/*"
  gov_g: "//gov/g/*"    → "go:/olym/g/*"
  gov_s: "//gov/s/*"    → "go:/olym/s/*"
  gov_k: "//gov/k/*"    → "go:/olym/k/*"
  gov_x: "//gov/x/*"    → "go:/olym/x/*"
```

## R-FAP-4 — Resolution Algorithm

```yaml
resolution_algorithm:
  steps:
    - 1: "Nhận FAP (vd: ha:/e/rr/actor/text-ractor)"
    - 2: "Xác định namespace root (ha:/, caw:/, ws:/, go:/, gh:, crates:)"
    - 3: "Tra bảng ánh xạ → RRP (vd: T:/hace/engine/rr/actor/text-ractor)"
    - 4: "Nếu platform = Linux/WSL → convert T:/ → /mnt/t/"
    - 5: "Verify RRP exists trước khi I/O"
  errors:
    fap_not_mapped: "R-FAP-5 VIOLATION"
    rrp_not_exist: "R-FAP-6 VIOLATION"
    cross_plane_skip: "R-FAP-7 VIOLATION"
```

## R-FAP-5 — Banned Patterns

| Pattern | Why |
|---|---|
| Hardcode `/mnt/t/...` trên Windows | Phải dùng FAP + resolve |
| Hardcode `T:/...` trên Linux | Phải dùng FAP + resolve |
| Mixed FAP + RRP trong cùng doc | Inconsistent — chọn 1 |
| Skip namespace prefix | Bắt buộc `ha:/`, `caw:/`, `ws:/`, `go:/`, `gh:` |

## R-FAP-6 — Plane-Awareness (Olym Specific)

Per `olym-structure-rule.ail v1.1`, Olym có 3 plane + 1 logical:

```yaml
planes:
  gh: "Public canonical cloud (GitHub baseline)"
  ha: "Local RRP override (Hace device)"
  ho: "Cloud mirror / distributed host"
  go: "Logical merged namespace"
```

Resolution order: **ha → ho → gh → first_match_wins**

